# 13. HPA vs Cluster Autoscaler

| Component | Function |
|---|---|
| HPA | Scales pods |
| Cluster Autoscaler | Scales worker nodes |

### What Happens When There Is No Node Capacity?

1. HPA requests more pod replicas.
2. New pods may enter Pending state.
3. Cluster Autoscaler, if enabled and properly configured, can add worker nodes.

